    "body": "Source repair is ready for integration. It replaces the invalid numeric bone and automatic time/interior gate with named PH_R_Hip/Gun_GripR physical attachment, a persistent unlit prop, and one radial selection per light toggle. It waits for Rockstar's weapon-swap task to become idle before returning Arthur from the hand-held lantern state. World collision remains enabled; only player/prop collision is suppressed. Static Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor#105 checks and exact vanilla Davy/electric radial record comparison pass. This is not installed or accepted in-game yet, so Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor#105 remains actionable until the combined build is installed and hash-verified.",
